                    <div class="stage-card__top"><span class="stage-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">02</span></div>
                    <h3>Stage 2: 1 micron scale-reducing carbon filter.</h3>
                    <p>Reduces chlorine, chloramines, VOCs, pesticides, iron and some heavy metals, and helps limit limescale.</p>
                    <div class="stage-card__media sx sx--carbon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sx-pipe sx-pipe--in"></span><span class="sx-pipe sx-pipe--out"></span><span class="sx-cart"><span class="sx-cart__core"></span><span class="sx-cart__cap sx-cart__cap--t"></span><span class="sx-cart__cap sx-cart__cap--b"></span></span><span class="sx-mol sx-mol--1">Cl</span><span class="sx-mol sx-mol--2">Cl</span><span class="sx-mol sx-mol--3">Cl</span><span class="sx-mol sx-mol--4">Cl</span><span class="sx-drop sx-drop--1"></span><span class="sx-drop sx-drop--2"></span><span class="sx-drop sx-drop--3"></span><span class="sx-label sx-label--in">Chlorine · VOCs</span><span class="sx-label sx-label--out">Reduced</span></div>
